        "section": "9",
        "section_title": "Criteria For Authorizing A Superior Qualifications Appointment",
        "text": "To use this authority, there must be an independent source of appointing authority such as being within reach as the result of a valid employment and recruitment process, being eligible for reinstatement, or being eligible under another appropriate hiring authority.",
