        "section_title": "Criteria For Authorizing A Superior Qualifications Appointment",
        "text": "These qualities must be significantly higher than that needed to be minimally qualified for the position and be of a more specialized quality compared to other candidates; b. Critical/Special Need In rare situations, USDA will have a special need for an applicant who would add",
